# Remote Job Engine (RJE)

**Automated job search pipeline — built by a banker, not a developer.**

An end-to-end job search automation system built on n8n, Supabase, Claude API, and Telegram. Processes Gmail job alerts, scores them against a real candidate profile, auto-applies by email where possible, and fires Telegram alerts for jobs needing manual attention.

Live on Railway. 16 workflows. Built and operated by Sachin Jadhav.

---

## Why I built this

I spent 19 years in banking. When I decided to move into remote consulting, I realised the job search process itself was a problem worth automating. Most job alerts are noise. Most applications go nowhere because they're generic. I wanted a system that reads every alert, scores it honestly against my actual profile, and only surfaces the ones worth pursuing.

So I built one.

---

## What it does

```
Gmail job alert → Claude AI scores it → High match? → Auto-apply by email
                                       → Manual job? → Telegram alert to me
                                       → All jobs   → Logged to Supabase
```

Every job alert that lands in my inbox gets processed automatically within minutes.

---

## System architecture

| Layer | Tool | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Trigger | Gmail + Schedule | Picks up job alert emails |
| AI Scoring | Claude API (Haiku) | Scores job against my profile |
| Storage | Supabase | Logs all jobs, scores, status |
| Alerts | Telegram | Notifies me of high-match jobs |
| Application | Email (Gmail) | Auto-applies for matched jobs |
| LinkedIn | LinkedIn API | Posts weekly activity updates |
| Content | Claude API | Drafts LinkedIn posts, cover letters |

---

## 16 Workflows (S1–S16)

| # | Workflow | What it does |
|---|---|---|
| S1 | Gmail Job Alert Intake | Reads unread job alert emails, extracts job details |
| S2 | Claude Job Scorer | Scores each job 0–100 against my profile |
| S3 | High Match Filter | Filters jobs scoring 75+ |
| S4 | Supabase Logger | Logs all jobs with scores to database |
| S5 | Telegram Alert | Fires Telegram message for high-match jobs |
| S6 | Email Auto-Apply | Sends application email for matched jobs |
| S7 | CV Tailor Trigger | Triggers CV tailoring for 80+ score jobs |
| S8 | CV Tailor (Claude) | Tailors CV1 or CV2 based on job type |
| S9 | Cover Letter Writer | Writes personalised cover letter per job |
| S10 | Application Tracker | Updates application status in Supabase |
| S11 | Follow-up Scheduler | Schedules follow-up emails 7 days after apply |
| S12 | Follow-up Sender | Sends follow-up email if no response |
| S13 | LinkedIn Post Drafter | Drafts weekly LinkedIn post via Claude |
| S14 | LinkedIn Post Merger | Combines post drafts for review |
| S15 | Weekly Report | Sends weekly summary to Telegram |
| S16 | Dead Job Cleanup | Archives jobs older than 30 days |

