## Claude scoring prompt — my actual profile

The Claude node scores every job against this profile:

```
Sachin Jadhav — Banking Domain Consultant
19 years SME/MSME credit appraisal and portfolio management
Core banking: Finacle (14+ years across IndusInd, South Indian Bank, ING Vysya, Axis Bank)
Systems: Loan Origination Systems (RLOS/CLOS), CRM, Flexcube
Products: Working Capital, LAP, LRD, Commodity Finance, Agri Lending
Tools: Power BI, Excel Advanced, SQL (basic), Python (basic)
Current: Founder, FinsightOne (live MSME credit advisory platform)

Target roles:
- Banking domain consultant (Finacle implementation teams)
- Credit advisory / MSME lending consultant
- Portfolio analytics and MIS roles
- Remote contract — USD/AED preferred

NOT targeting:
- Basel II/III or IFRS9 modelling roles
- Pure quant / risk modelling
- On-site permanent roles in India
```

Score 80+ → auto-apply. Score 75–79 → Telegram alert. Below 75 → log only.

---

## Tech stack

- **n8n** — workflow automation (Railway hosted)
- **Supabase** — PostgreSQL database for job tracking
- **Claude API** — Haiku model for scoring and content generation
- **Gmail OAuth** — job alert intake and application sending
- **Telegram Bot** — real-time alerts and weekly reports

