## What I learned building this

I am not a developer. I built this entirely using n8n's visual workflow editor, Claude API, and a lot of trial and error. Every node was configured manually. Every bug was debugged by reading the execution log and fixing one thing at a time.

The point was not to write clean code. The point was to solve a real problem — and it does.

